note Ctrl+s or the save button in the top bar writes the map to .codemap/, one file per path, writing only the files whose text changed and deleting the files of removed paths. The button reads 'save *' while there are unsaved changes. A map that could not be read at startup is never saved over. After a save, the reload that the file watcher would trigger is suppressed because the stored stamp matches.

